# <%name%> Feed

Packs and stacks for this company, read by `aidev-instruct` from this repository's latest release.

## Add a Pack

1. Create `packs/<%name%>-<topic>/pack.json` with its rules, skills or agents.
2. Run `npx aidev-instruct@<%version%> feed validate`.
3. Merge to `main`.

## Release

Run the Release workflow in the Actions tab. It bumps the changed packs and stacks, writes changelogs, commits `Release <version>` and tags it. Projects get the release on their next `update`.

## Use the Feed

```bash
npx aidev-instruct@latest feeds add <%name%> github:<owner>/<%name%> --tokenEnv <%token%>
npx aidev-instruct@latest add <%name%>-example
```
